# LOCAL.md

This is a template for local-only notes, secrets, and environment configuration.
Copy this file to `LOCAL.md` and fill in your own values. `LOCAL.md` is gitignored — never commit it.

## Development shortcuts

- Local Astro dev server: http://localhost:4321
- Local Sanity Studio: http://localhost:3333
- Cloudflare Pages preview: https://wugweb.pages.dev

## Secrets (never commit)

```bash
# .env (also gitignored)
SANITY_PROJECT_ID=splvhmk1
SANITY_DATASET=production
SANITY_TOKEN=sk...                 # Editor token for migrations
SANITY_SYNC_TOKEN=...              # Auth token for /api/sync
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://...      # Neon connection string
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=...           # For wrangler deploys
FRAMER_API_KEY=fr_...              # Framer API (optional; design/asset pulls)
```

